diff --git a/docs/utils.rst b/docs/utils.rst
index 995c171..f1a897d 100644
--- a/docs/utils.rst
+++ b/docs/utils.rst
@@ -217,6 +217,10 @@ Example usage::
     import click
     click.edit(filename='/etc/passwd')
 
+Pass ``working_dir`` to launch the editor from a selected directory. Relative
+filenames are interpreted by the editor from that directory; temporary-file
+editing continues to pass an absolute filename.
+
 
 Launching Applications
 ----------------------
